pported condition; state credential and bypass granularity precisely, with current source links; preserve independent auditor, append-only retention, refusal, reconciliation, availability and activation gates. Distinguish researched capability from an executed spike. Do not claim GITHUB_TOKEN custom-ref permissions, real deployment success, or historical test execution from documentation alone. Use a concise dated status or explicit unresolved prerequisite where proof is absent. Any material new credential, trust or deployment-policy choice needs an ordinary proposal and adoption before it is presented as settled.\n\nWork on request/deployment-ruleset-clarity from then-current main. Read the complete note for contradictory surviving passages, but avoid expanding this into another deployment design. Use current behavior provenance for described project behavior and acknowledge ordinary inherited staleness without routine refiling. Publish exact-path artifacts, obtain independent Architecture/Security/Simplification review of the exact head, ratify approval, seal the main merge, push origin/main, check CI and remove the owned worktree and branch. Validate the actual changed note and its links; a docset gate that excludes notes/ is not evidence that the changed claims are sound. Source delivery closes this request. No real GitHub settings, rulesets, keys, tokens, workflows, repo creation, service change or Action-drain implementation is authorized. #8162 remains deferred.","body":{"conditions":"Correct the remaining deployment-note ruleset/mirror and credential claims against current primary evidence, preserve gates and explicit unknowns; bounded documentation delivery only, independently reviewed exact-head sealed main/push/CI/cleanup.","head":"6f4864fdaf2069f9ab917286e537db05bea12f51","stale_bases":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:0f2dca051fc1b6fb5b410876c58641e06c29f7c2, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:42549578ed